# Pinned inputs for the Roclet native dependency build.
#
# Every value here is a *pin*: the build verifies each source archive and patch
# against these hashes before use, and cross-checks the Roc Toolkit content tree.
# Changing a pin is a deliberate act -- do not bump silently.
#
# The upstream source archives live in ./vendor/ so that a fresh checkout builds
# fully offline. They are upstream *source* archives (no prebuilt binaries).

